# Internal documents stay out of the repository. The runbooks hold production identifiers and the rest are working
# notes, plans and vendor specifications. They live in the local main checkout only, and deployment evidence goes under
# docs/runbooks/.local/. README.md, DESIGN.md and AGENTS.md at the root stay versioned.
docs/

# Files that tools write for a one-off analysis, such as a spreadsheet of real vehicle GPS routes. They hold production
# data and must never be added by a blanket `git add .`.
outputs/
